{"fig_2": "Fig. 2 is a graphical representation included in the document, specifically designed to display the performance metrics of a nominal prediction model applied to a test set, focusing on various ECG abnormalities.|Here is another description: Fig. 2 is a graphical representation that displays data related to the performance of a model in detecting abnormalities, as part of a study comparing the model's results with those of medical residents and students.|Here is another description: Fig. 2 is a graphical representation that shows the precision-recall scores of the medical residents and students, as well as the point corresponding to the maximum F1 score for each abnormality. It is used to visually compare the performance of these individuals with that of the DNN."},
