{"results_of_the_analysis": "The results of the analysis refer to the findings and conclusions drawn from the review and comparison of mistakes made by a DNN, medical residents, and students in a medical context. These results are part of a study aimed at evaluating and comparing the performance of different groups in medical error identification."},
