{"precision_ppv_recall_sensitivity_specificity_and_f1_score_using_bootstrapping": "Precision (PPV), recall (sensitivity), specificity, and F1 score are performance metrics used to evaluate the effectiveness of classification models. Bootstrapping is a statistical method for estimating the sampling distribution of a statistic by resampling with replacement from the original data."},
