{"misclassification_distribution_of_the_dnn_medical_residents_and_students": "The misclassification distribution of the DNN, medical residents, and students refers to the pattern or frequency of incorrect classifications made by a deep neural network (DNN), medical residents, and students when diagnosing or categorizing medical data, which was the focus of comparison using the McNemar test."},
