{"ecg_interpretation__can_be__extremely_difficult_in_complex_and_borderline_situations": "The phrase \"can be\" indicates a potential or possibility. In this context, it suggests that under certain conditions, specifically complex and borderline situations, the difficulty of ECG interpretation may reach an extreme level."},
