{"perspectives_for_future_research_and_clinical_applications": "The perspectives for future research and clinical applications involve exploring the DNN's capability to diagnose multiple and complex ECG abnormalities, testing the algorithm in real-life situations, and potentially improving access to healthcare in low- and middle-income countries."},
