{"tnmg": "The TNMG is a large telehealth service that provides a significant number of ECG examinations daily and is expanding its coverage across a large part of Brazil.|Here is another description: The TNMG is a large telehealth service that provides a significant amount of medical data and services, particularly in the area of electrocardiogram (ECG) examinations. It serves as a critical resource for medical research and the development of diagnostic technologies.|Here is another description: The TNMG is a large telehealth service that provides extensive medical services, including the performance of over 2000 ECGs daily. It serves as a significant platform for medical research and the application of advanced diagnostic technologies.|Here is another description: The Telehealth Network of Minas Gerais (TNMG) is a public telehealth system designed to provide healthcare services across a wide geographical area. It is instrumental in delivering medical support and diagnostics to various municipalities.|Here is another description: The Telehealth Network of Minas Gerais (TNMG) is a public telehealth system that assists a significant number of municipalities in the state of Minas Gerais, Brazil. It plays a crucial role in providing healthcare services through technology, particularly in remote and underserved areas."},
