{"more_than_2000_ecgs_a_day": "\"More than 2000 ECGs a day\" refers to the high volume of electrocardiogram tests that the TNMG conducts on a daily basis. This high throughput is essential for both patient care and the accumulation of data necessary for research and algorithm training in ECG interpretation."},
{"tnmg__is_expanding_its_geographical_coverage_over__a_large_part_of_a_continental_country_brazil": "The TNMG is in the process of increasing the areas it serves within a vast continental country, aiming to provide its telehealth services to a broader population. This expansion is crucial for improving healthcare access in underserved regions."},
