{"final_model__is_the_one_with__the_best_validation_results_during_the_optimization_process": "The phrase \"is the one with\" indicates that the final model is selected based on a specific criterion. In this context, it means that the final model is chosen because it meets a particular requirement or condition."},
{"the_best_validation_results_during_the_optimization_process": "The best validation results during the optimization process signify the performance metrics obtained by the model on a validation dataset. These results are used to evaluate the model's effectiveness and to select the best-performing version during the training phase."},
