{"splits__ordered_by__randomly_by_date_and_stratified_by_patients": "The predicate describes the method by which the dataset splits are ordered. This ordering is crucial as it affects the distribution and characteristics of the data in each split, thereby influencing the performance metrics of the neural networks being evaluated."},
