{"global_regional_and_national_age_sex_specific_mortality_for_282_causes_of_death_in_195_countries_and_territories_1980_2017": "The object of the study, \"Global, regional, and national age-sex-specific mortality for 282 causes of death in 195 countries and territories, 1980-2017,\" describes a detailed and comprehensive dataset. This dataset encompasses mortality rates across various age groups, sexes, and causes of death, providing a granular view of global health disparities and trends over nearly four decades."},
