{"errors_in_the_computerized_electrocardiogram_interpretation_of_cardiac_rhythm": "Errors in the computerized electrocardiogram interpretation of cardiac rhythm refer to inaccuracies or mistakes that occur when computer algorithms are used to analyze and interpret electrocardiogram (ECG) data, which can lead to incorrect diagnoses or misinterpretations of a patient's cardiac rhythm."},
