{"the_design_analysis_or_interpretation_of_the_study": "The object specifies the aspects of the study where the funding agencies had no role, which includes the design, analysis, or interpretation of the study."},
{"open_access_funding": "Open access funding refers to financial support provided to make research publications freely available to the public without any paywalls or subscription barriers. This funding is crucial for promoting the dissemination of knowledge and ensuring that research findings are accessible to a wide audience, including researchers, students, and the general public."},
{"open_access_funding__provided_by__uppsala_university": "The predicate \"provided by\" indicates the source or entity responsible for offering the open access funding. In this context, it specifies that Uppsala University is the institution that has supplied the necessary financial support to make the research publication openly accessible."},
{"a_h_r_m_h_r_g_m_m_p_d_m_o_p_r_g_j_a_c_m_p_s_f_and_a_l_p_r": "A.H.R., M.H.R., G.M.M.P., D.M.O., P.R.G., J.A.C, M.P.S.F, and A.L.P.R. are a group of authors who contributed to various aspects of a research project, including study design, implementation, data analysis, and manuscript writing."},
