{"a_h_r_m_h_r_and_c_r_a": "A.H.R., M.H.R, and C.R.A. are individuals involved in the study who were responsible for specific technical tasks. They contributed to the implementation and tuning of the deep neural network as part of the research project.|Here is another description: A.H.R., M.H.R, and C.R.A. are individuals who contributed to the technical aspects of a research project involving a deep neural network. They were involved in the selection of the network's architecture and played a key role in its development."},
