{"the_architecture": "The architecture refers to the specific design and structure of the deep neural network that was selected by A.H.R., M.H.R, and C.R.A. for implementation in the study. This choice is fundamental to the functioning and performance of the neural network."},
{"a_h_r_m_h_r_and_c_r_a__implemented_and_tuned__the_deep_neural_network": "The phrase \"implemented and tuned\" refers to the actions taken by the subject entities to bring the deep neural network into functional existence and to optimize its performance. This involves coding the network according to the chosen architecture and adjusting its parameters to improve accuracy and efficiency."},
{"the_deep_neural_network": "The deep neural network is a complex machine learning model that was the central component of the research project. It required careful design, implementation, and tuning to process and analyze data effectively as part of the study."},
