{"the_semi_supervised_methodology_to_extract_the_text_label": "The semi-supervised methodology to extract the text label is a specific technique or process that D.M.O. implemented. This methodology likely involves using a combination of labeled and unlabeled data to train a model for extracting text labels, which is a common approach in machine learning to improve model performance when labeled data is scarce."},
