{"a_h_r_m_h_r_p_w_m_t_b_s_and_a_l_p_r__contributed_to__the_writing": "The phrase \"contributed to\" indicates that the subjects played a role in the collaborative effort of creating the written content of the manuscript, sharing their expertise and intellectual input."},
{"the_writing": "The writing refers to the manuscript's text, which encompasses the study's findings, methodologies, and discussions, reflecting the collective intellectual contributions of all authors."},
{"all_authors": "All authors refer to the collective group of individuals who have contributed to the creation and review of the manuscript. Their roles varied from study design, project leadership, implementation of methodologies, data analysis, to database maintenance.|Here is another description: All authors refer to the collective group of individuals who have contributed to the research project and manuscript preparation. This includes those involved in study design, data collection, analysis, and writing, as well as those who provided critical revisions."},
{"all_authors__revised_it_critically_for__important_intellectual_content": "Revised it critically for indicates the action taken by the subject (all authors) towards the object (important intellectual content). This action involves a thorough review and assessment to ensure the quality, accuracy, and relevance of the content."},
