{"the_submitted_manuscript": "The submitted manuscript is the final document prepared by the authors for publication, encapsulating the research findings, methodologies, results, and conclusions of the study. It represents the culmination of the authors' collaborative efforts and intellectual contributions."},
{"this_study": "This study refers to a secondary analysis of anonymized data stored in the TNMG, which was conducted under the oversight of the Research Ethics Committee of the Universidade Federal de Minas Gerais.|Here is another description: This study refers to a research project that involves a secondary analysis of anonymized data stored in the TNMG. It is designed to comply with all relevant ethical regulations."},
