{"automatic_diagnosis": "Automatic diagnosis refers to the process of using technology to analyze medical data and provide a diagnosis without human intervention. In the context of a 12-lead ECG, it involves interpreting the electrical activity of the heart to identify any abnormalities or conditions."},
