{"deep_neural_network": "A deep neural network is a type of machine learning model that consists of multiple layers of interconnected nodes or neurons. It is designed to recognize patterns and make decisions based on complex data inputs, such as those from a 12-lead ECG, to facilitate automatic diagnosis.|Here is another description: A deep neural network is a type of artificial intelligence model that consists of multiple layers of interconnected nodes or neurons. It is designed to recognize patterns and make decisions based on input data, simulating the way the human brain operates."},
