{"cardiovascular_diseases": "Cardiovascular diseases encompass a range of conditions that affect the heart and blood vessels, including coronary artery disease, heart failure, and stroke. These conditions are a major global health concern due to their prevalence and impact on mortality rates.|Here is another description: Cardiovascular diseases encompass a range of conditions that affect the heart and blood vessels, including coronary artery disease, heart failure, and stroke. These conditions are often linked to lifestyle factors, genetic predisposition, and other health issues."},
