{"clinical_and_prognostic_studies": "Clinical and prognostic studies involve research aimed at understanding the course and outcomes of diseases, as well as predicting future health events based on current data. In this context, these studies focus on evaluating the effectiveness and predictive capabilities of ECG examinations in a clinical setting."},
