{"diagnosis_of_other_classes_of_abnormalities": "The \"diagnosis of other classes of abnormalities\" refers to ECG abnormalities that were not assessed in the study, such as those related to acute coronary syndromes or cardiac chamber enlargements. These are complex and less common forms of ECG abnormalities that require further testing to determine the DNN's diagnostic accuracy."},
