{"tnmg": "The TNMG is a large telehealth service from which the dataset used in the study was obtained. It is known for performing a high volume of ECGs daily and is in the process of expanding its geographical coverage across a significant portion of Brazil.|Here is another description: The TNMG is a large telehealth service that provides a significant amount of medical data and services, particularly in the field of electrocardiography. It serves as a crucial platform for collecting and analyzing ECG data, contributing to research and clinical applications in cardiology.|Here is another description: The TNMG is a large telehealth service that conducts over 2000 ECGs daily and serves as a significant resource for ECG interpretation and diagnosis.|Here is another description: The Telehealth Network of Minas Gerais (TNMG) is a public telehealth system designed to provide healthcare services across a wide geographical area. It is instrumental in delivering medical support and diagnostics to various municipalities.|Here is another description: The Telehealth Network of Minas Gerais (TNMG) is a public telehealth system that assists a vast majority of municipalities in the state of Minas Gerais, Brazil. It plays a crucial role in providing healthcare services through technology, particularly in remote and underserved areas."},
