{"study": "The study refers to a research effort aimed at evaluating the effectiveness of a deep neural network (DNN) in recognizing electrocardiogram (ECG) abnormalities. It highlights the potential of DNN technology in improving ECG interpretation and clinical practice.|Here is another description: The study refers to a research project that developed an end-to-end deep neural network (DNN) capable of accurately recognizing six ECG abnormalities in S12L-ECG exams. It aims to compare the diagnostic performance of the DNN with that of medical residents and students."},
