{"uni_g_automatic_analysis_automatic_diagnosis": "Uni-G automatic analysis (automatic diagnosis) refers to a software-driven process that automatically analyzes medical data to produce diagnostic information. This system is designed to provide quick and consistent annotations, though it may have limitations in accuracy compared to expert human diagnosis."},
