{"use_residual_network_without_the_preactivation_architecture_proposed_in_ref_48": "Using a residual network without the preactivation architecture proposed in ref. [48] refers to an alternative configuration of the residual neural network. This modification involves removing the preactivation step, which typically includes batch normalization and activation functions before the weight layers, to see if it yields better results in the given context."},
