{"measurement_errors_noise_errors_unexplained_errors_dnn_only_conceptual_and_attention_errors_medical_residents_and_students_only": "The objects of classification include measurement errors, which are inaccuracies in the measurement process; noise errors, which are caused by external interference; unexplained errors specific to DNNs, which are errors without a clear cause; and conceptual and attention errors specific to medical residents and students, which are due to misunderstandings or lapses in attention."},
